{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LTi4Z7sDoCnShxyHRzJNB1","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Vendor Policy — Fictional Meridian Works (MW)\n2\t\n3\t## VEN-1 Prohibited vendors\n4\tA purchase from a prohibited vendor **must not proceed** without written compliance-officer authorization. Emergency status alone does not change this prohibition.\n5\t\n6\t## VEN-2 Exception authorization\n7\tA specific written authorization by the compliance officer permits use of an otherwise prohibited vendor for the approved transaction. No such authorization may be inferred from manager or finance approval.\n8\t\n9\t## VEN-3 Approved vendors\n10\tAn approved vendor is one designated approved in the transaction facts. The question set explicitly identifies vendor status when relevant.\n11\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c2d46a16-2847-4d6d-8dda-ba2a5efa37ee","uuid":"0e3a2109-c108-4640-bab9-cb73f3725775","timestamp":"2026-10-13T19:21:51.522Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\paradox-sessions-20261013\\CH_FRESH_01\\H2\\04-vendor-policy.md","content":"# Vendor Policy — Fictional Meridian Works (MW)\n\n## VEN-1 Prohibited vendors\nA purchase from a prohibited vendor **must not proceed** without written compliance-officer authorization. Emergency status alone does not change this prohibition.\n\n## VEN-2 Exception authorization\nA specific written authorization by the compliance officer permits use of an otherwise prohibited vendor for the approved transaction. No such authorization may be inferred from manager or finance approval.\n\n## VEN-3 Approved vendors\nAn approved vendor is one designated approved in the transaction facts. The question set explicitly identifies vendor status when relevant.\n","numLines":11,"startLine":1,"totalLines":11}}}
